    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluudae Yoshua xoorór Israeli gari ateét baraá yaamaá Shekémúrí ale, dinkwa nee bariiser'ine nee geeraharuuser'ine nee har'ohuuser'ine nee múk urén oo Israeliwo. Nari hardihiyé' dír geeraá Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua muu sleémeero guri báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, i kaahi, ‹Aáng baabi'iihúng, Tera, baabuú Abrahamu, nee Nahori afaá yaaér Eufrate ngina hotaatiné'. Inooín munguaá hatlá' ngiri sagadiyuusiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng baabuúhúng Abrahamu nguri ar tláw afaá yaaeedá' wa ale, nguri geerahaár baraá yaamu sleémeero awa Kana'ani, nguri xwaylár yaariírií haniís. Nguri Isakawí haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka nguri Yakobo nee Esauwí haniís. Esau nguri tlom'aá yaamaá Seirírí haniís tawa aalirós. Ala Yakobo nee na/iiwós nina /eetiyé' Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo aníng Mose nee Aroni ngiri ya/aáw, yaamaá Misri ngiri muúx ar tlehhmi'iidá' naa tleéhh baraá ayaadá' wa ale, kuungá' nuri duúx baraadá' wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabi'iihúng ngiri baraá Mísrír wa duúx, tari hardaté' afaá tlawtá Shamu. Aluuwo xoorór Misri xwaylitérhúng ngiri aluú wa gús. Múk farsuú i tsa/aa/ám kuri ya/aáw nee gaarduuín awa muqsla ay afaá tlawtá Shamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoorór Israeli niwa amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wí /aa/ír, aníng giwti ngari tla/angwhúngí qaás nee múk Misri, ma'aá tlawi ngiri gawaaíní xoptís. Kuungá' ilahunge muruudá' naa tlehhiít ugwa aandé'.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aluuwo kureeraá yaariire tari baraá xaanxáy wa hoté'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo nuri huúw ay baraá yaamaá múk Amori, kudá' gayuú da/aáw oo yaaér Yordanír hoót. Inooín nina slaqwarár ayé' amorhúng. Aníng ngiri gawaá dabaahúngií qaás, ngiri hhaamiís. Kuungá' yaamuuín kiri hayoté'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Balaki garmoó Sipori, waawutmoó xoorór Moabu, niri slaqwarár áy amór xoorór Israeli. Inós Bala'amu garmoó Beori guri ateét as kuungá' nuwa lu'usi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng firór Bala'amu ana sií', inós kuungá' nuri tsuúq. Gawaá adoorihe aníng kuungá' nuri baraá dabaá Balaki wa tuú/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo yaaér Yordani kari waarahhé', tari hardaté' Yerikórí ale. Múk Yeriko nari slaqwarár áy amorhúng. Tina alkoné' nee xoorór Amori, nee ar Perisi, nee ar Kana'ani, nee ar Hiti, nee ar Girgashi, nee ar Hifi, nee ar Yebusiro. Aníng xoorduuká' ngiri gawaá dabaahúngií qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng xoorduudá' ngiri diwílí tleés, waawituú tsár oo xoorór Amori nguri tlatlahhaás ar diwíl, ala a ar paangaduhungeeká, laqaá ar ga/alduuhungeeká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Yaamaá tawo ina sleeré' awa ta hamér wa xintsi'iiká nee gixsadaá taa tlehhi'iiká ina i daté', nee mamaá sabibuú taa dosli'iiká ina /agé', nee awa seituúniro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gimsé', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ilaiwawa/aak nee sagadiyusaak ar muunuú /awaák nee ar inkihhimu. Munguiidá' baabi'iihúng naa sagadiyusiyé' gayuú yaaér Eufrátér wa ale, nee baraá yaamaá Misriro, amoosíngí kwahhaak, daqaní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ku sagadiyusá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa sagadiyusa' a sla'a'aaká, gimsé', tsawdimé' laarí munguaá ta sagadiyusa' slawaak. Bar awa ta sla'a' an kudá' baabi'iihúng naa sagadiyusiyé' afaá yaaér Eufrátér wa ale, laqaá bar awa ta sla'a' an kudá' múk Amori ni sagadiyusiya', mukdá' ayaaín hamí ta hota', tlawsé'. Ala aníng nee múk dooeé' sleémeero AAKOÓ MUNGÚ un sagadiyusaán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero tari oó', «Tisíng i amoosií pa/, atén mitiwa sleér, ar atén AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa geexawaan sagadiyeede, nari munguaá hatlá' sagadiyér awaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, inós an kudá' atén nee baabi'iirene taa duux baraá yaamaá Misrír wa ale, yaamaá lawaali'iima kawa /ayaán. Slám laydaá uren awa waa/oo/amór koomá' gina tleéhh dír ilaarén wa ale. Inós tari deaaén baraá lohduudá' sleémeero nira ohiimani, nee baraá tla/eeraá xoorduudá' sleémeero nira waraahhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám AAKOÓ MUNGÚ xoorduudá' sleémeero gina geeraarén wa tlatlahhaás, ín xoorór Amori, kudá' baraá yaamuuká' ngaa hootiye'. Gawaá adoorihe atén sleeme AAKOÓ MUNGÚ un sagadiyusaán, asma inós an Munguúrén.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Yoshua mukdá' guri báy, «Kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ sagadiyede u asleera'aaká, asma inós a Munguú hhoohhoó'. Slám a Munguú da/itá koóm, nee inós tlakweemaahúng nee dakumisuhunge gi gurtlayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' barnaxes AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ugwa gunqaaresé', munguaá /eetuuse kiri sagadiyusé', inós aqo nun al warqáy, nuri slahh'eemiis, nuri xooro qwaarees kitangw nuwa hhooeemáy tlehhahhiít.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala inooín Yoshua nguri bayé', «Aasla'áy no. Atén aqo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ un sagadiyusaán.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua mukdá' guri báy, «Kuungá' a lamabu'uuse daandemoohunge adór tara tsawdiindé' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa sagadiyusa'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín nguri bayé', «Kahhoo', atén a lamabu'uuse daandemoorene.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
