        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá kaangwihe Yoshua garmoó Nuni sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri gwaá', kureeri ngaa /aáy a tsiiruú wák nee mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri foól baraá yaamuudaá aalirós awa ta babay Timnat-sera, tidá' alaá tlom'aá yaamaá Efraimúrí dirii', bihhaá /iya awa tloomár Ga'ashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
